# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Vite Client Bundle)
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are bundled into client-side JS.
# NEVER put sensitive private API keys or secret credentials here!
